laya-codex runs the Laya model and its fine-tuned derivative laya-code at
runtime. Model weights are not part of this repository or its release archives;
they are downloaded separately:

- Laya, Copyright Convai Innovations (Apache-2.0),
  https://huggingface.co/convaiinnovations/laya
- ModernBERT-large encoder and tokenizer, Answer.AI (Apache-2.0),
  https://huggingface.co/answerdotai/ModernBERT-large

laya-codex talks to a separately installed Moon server
(https://github.com/pilotspace/moon) over the Redis protocol; Moon is not
bundled with or linked into laya-codex.
